      "title": "IPv6: Ensure that fragment extension header length is adjusted",
      "message": "IPv6: Ensure that fragment extension header length is adjusted\n\nIf we're putting extension headers under the IPv6 protocol item,\nmake sure that we adjust the length to the pending value after\nprocessing all extension headers.\n\nWe don't always call a subdissector; there might be an exception\n(including where the frame was truncated at capture), or we might\nterminate in the fragment header routine because this isn't the\nframe where reassembly was finished.\n\nFix #16455\n",
